          <pre class="code"><code set:html={hiN(taskAns)} /></pre>
          <p>Output, one per line: <code>&#123;Ana=3, Ben=2, Carla=1&#125;</code>, <code>&#123;Dan=1&#125;</code>, <code>&#123;&#125;</code>, and <code>&#123;Ben=2, ben=1&#125;</code>.</p>
          <p>Here is the map after each vote in room 1:</p>
