          <p>The map never gets two Ana entries: <code>put</code> on a key that is already there <b>replaces</b> the old count. In room 4, "Ben" and "ben" are two different keys, because Java compares keys letter by letter, and B and b have different character codes. The capital comes first in a TreeMap.</p>
          <p>Here are two common mistakes:</p>
